  id: carta_001
  titulo: MC Catseye
  arteCarta: {fileID: -7442846639724526032, guid: e68c430477f30734da302be681e29179, type: 3}
  descricao: MC Catseye has become one of the hottest names in the music scene. One
    song on his upcoming album references the mother of one of the country's most
    notorious gangsters. Do you keep the song on the album?
  contratar:
    textoResultado: Less than a week after the album's release, MC Catseye is killed
      in a shooting. The song becomes a viral anti-crime anthem, increasing album
      sales by 300%.
    deltaDinheiro: 300
    arteResultado: {fileID: 0}
  naoContratar:
    textoResultado: The song is removed from the album. Without it, none of the remaining
      tracks gain traction, and MC Catseye becomes known as just another promising
      artist who never made it.
    deltaDinheiro: -50
    arteResultado: {fileID: 0}
